    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17198" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτρεστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not trembling, fearless,</i> Trag., and <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
